# Architecture

Keep strict separation between layers. Never put business logic in React components.

| Layer | Location | Responsibility |
|-------|----------|----------------|
| UI | `src/components`, `src/features` | Presentation and user events only |
| State | `src/stores` | App state, orchestration, calls to IPC |
| IPC | `src/lib` | Typed Tauri invoke wrappers |
| Commands | `src-tauri/src/commands` | Thin IPC handlers; validate then delegate |
| Engine | `src-tauri/src/engine` | Download orchestration |
| Database | `src-tauri/src/db` | SQLite access |
| Media | `src-tauri/src/media` | yt-dlp / FFmpeg process wrappers |

## Rules

- Components call stores or thin hooks — not `invoke` directly for business flows.
- Commands must not embed download/DB logic; call engine/db/media modules.
- Share types via serde JSON models and matching TypeScript interfaces in `src/lib/types`.
